<title>USA: Omaha hogs off steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs off steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady. Top $58.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>   US 1-3    230-260 lbs mostly 58.75</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Firm to 1.00 higher. Top 55.00.</p>
<p>   US 1-3    350-450 lbs    50.00-50.50</p>
<p>		 450-500 lbs    51.50</p>
<p>   US 2-3    500-700 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
</text>
